  data: {
    LLM: 'Focus on capturing high-value cards, especially the seven of coins (settebello). Try to maintain cards that can capture multiple table cards. Avoid leaving easy captures for opponents.\n\nCount cards to track what has been played, especially the coins suit. Set up sweeps by leaving table combinations that you can capture on your next turn. Balance capturing cards now versus setting up future captures.\n\nUse tactical plays to force opponents into unfavorable positions. Control the tempo to ensure you get advantageous final captures. Track opponent patterns to predict their holdings. Set up situations where any card an opponent plays can be captured.',
